Hello everybody!

Friends, first of all we want to highlight the issue that occured right after the latest update. From time to time the game crashes with the error "Memory can not be read\write." It arose after the game engine update and it is partly fixed already.We apologize for the long decision, it will soon all work as expected!

To the good news.Our team is actively working on preparing a large update, which contains new quests, location and a lot of new clothes for the characters. Work on the location is almost done and next week we are preparing some game’s elements for it.

Well, today we will release a small update, which will bring a number of long-awaited fixes and changes:

UPDATE: [06/03/2018]
[Changes]
1) Updated visual effects (vfx) when hitting different surfaces (metal, wood, stone, water);
2) Updated effect of flying bullets;
3) Improved synchronization of sounds and steps’ animation;
4) Reduced the speed of fog movement in the "Last survivor" mode;
5) Added a special message in the “Last Survivor” mode that informs about the required number of players and the timer before the automatic start of the match;
6) The system of damage in the "Last Survivor" mode has been improved. Now the damage from toxic fog depends on the time of the match. At the first narrowing, the fog will cause a small amount of damage, but the closer the end, the more damage and toxicity the player will receive;
7)The firearm now is not given as a reward in the "Last survivor" mode. Only the winner can take the weapons from the current match and use it in the next one;
8) Now the reward like items (except firearms) is obtained by all players in the "Last survivor" mode. The higher the place you occupied, the more items you will receive. Minimal reward: 1 item. Maximum: 5 items;
9) Improved landing of the character in the water, added effects of splashing water;
10) Improved tree shader. Now the trees and bushes look more bushy and smooth;
11) Updated shot sounds for: RPD, SVD, AKMS / AKM, AK-12, AK-74, GALIL, USAS-12, RPK, AKN, PP 1901, VSS, AUG, M4A1, AS VAL, XM8 LMG;
12) Updated effect of the grenade explosion.

[Fixes]
1) Fixed a bug when voice communication stopped working;
2) Fixed a bug when the LOD levels at the doors were closed, whereas when you’re near the door is open;
3) Fixed a bug when the match in the "Last survivor" mode did not start;
4) Fixed a bug when was thrown back to the menu after loading the scene in the "Last survivor" mode;
5) Fixed a bug when the notification of the number of remaining players popped up, even when searching for players in the "Last survivor" mode;
6) Fixed one of the errors that could cause memory leaks thus the game was crashed;
7) Fixed a bug when players could fall under the water and move there;
8) Fixed a bug when you could crawl under the water;
9) Fixed a bug when duplicate game servers could be displayed;
10) Fixed bug when NPCs became immortal;
11) Fixed a bug when NPCs did not react to players during the fight;
12) Fixed a bug when NPCs were obsessed with recharging weapons;
13) Fixed a bug when the map window wasn’t opened if you click on the active quest window (if there were no active quests);
14) Fixed a bug when you could crawl very quickly.

[Innovations]
1) Added the ability to sell and buy game items in the "Last survivor" mode (the purchase of firearms is impossible);
2) Added new crosshairs: "dot", "small cross" and hidden (without crosshair). The choice of the crosshair  is made in the settings menu;
3) Added the sound of a toxic fog when approaching in the "Last survivor" mode.

