Hello, friends! Starting tomorrow, our team will work on the next update, the release of which is scheduled for mid-September. 

This update will be great and will bring the following: 
1) New open location "Primorye"; 
2) New quests; 
3) Several new types of weapons; 
4) New clothes. 
More details will be shared soon!

